-- words --
A result.retract event in the clone's trace is listed as not read: the store holds a Goal, and the clone's trace holds a result.retract event; hyp status lists it under not read at replay as an unknown event type.
-- run --
HYP_ACTOR=owner hyp status
-- floor: contains --
not read at replay:
-- floor: contains --
unknown event type result.retract
